From 763e5403e19f2f52a67f3ecdf86e35130530ba8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Macready <william.macready@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:57:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] test(semantics): preserve canonical plan regressions
 under physical storage

All fourteen existing Plan targets built green. Retained all 281 original assertions (149 evaluated checks and 132 proof items) and evaluation labels; added two canonical-layout proof helpers. Retired canonical slot assertions follow the unmapped-slot invariant without weakening expected values.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
